  "bio": "Gabriel Luna is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in watercolor and color-infused dotwork styles, crafting masterful ink art that vibrantly comes to life on skin. Operating out of Jacksonville, United States, Gabriel maintains a supreme level of cleanliness in their studio, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every client's tattoo session. Reach out to Gabriel Luna at Forbidden Tattoo in North Carolina to experience their exceptional work and commitment to a clean tattooing process.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Jacksonville, Florida, United States"
